cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "ebsc_tensorflow: A Differentiable Time-Warped Yen Interpolator"
abstract: >-
  TensorFlow counterpart of ebsc: differentiable time-warping and time-warped Yen
  interpolator for event-based sampling. The package contains an approximate
  time-warped Yen interpolator that is differentiable with respect to the
  instantaneous bandwidth, and NN-TW, a neural network that estimates the
  instantaneous bandwidth from level-crossing samples and is trained on the
  reconstruction error.
